note """analysis check: NOT an unconsumed output. `ok` is a DECLARED signature output, consumed by whatever caller binds it, so an analysis looking only inside this flow must not call it a dead end. `stray` is the known positive in the same file: nothing declares it and nothing reads it, so it IS one."""
flow screening (Order) -> ok OkResult, bad ErrResult
import "github.com/acme/fraud"
import "acme.dev/flows/audit"
branch check fraud.Clean from in -> ok, bad
transform stray audit.Tag from bad
